Date: Mon, 14 Apr 2025 12:54:45 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [FSW-11993] fs1: added board and dtsi for pm arc

With this patch, defined new board for pmfw arc
of compute die. which is replacement of reset
arc in upcoming project.

Change-Id: I13da39c370c59c1c14c08630390da91a36f9ea08
---

